  "solution": "The BODMAS rule is given as follows:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/82c3e40a02b8c826e0d868ad0661efd9dcbce5afdb4d9591a54019ab40c8b055.png] \n\nFrom 40 A 10 B 8 C 15 = 65, we get-\n\n→ 40 × __**10 ÷ 8**__ + 15 = 65\n\n→ __**40 × 1.25**__ + 15 = 65\n\n→ __**50 + 15**__ = 65\n\n→ 65 = 65\n\nFrom 15 A 30 B 9 C 20 = 70, we get-\n\n→ 15 × __**30**____** ÷ 9__** + 20 = 70\n\n→ __**15 **____**× ****10/3**__**__ __**+ 20 = 70\n\n→ 50 + 20 = 70\n\nSo, 'A' means '×' , 'B' means '÷' and C means '+'.\n\nSimilarly for 7 A 9 B 3 C 8 = ?, we get-\n\n→ 7 × 9__ ÷ 3__ + 8 = ?\n\n→ __**7 × 3**__ + 8 = ?\n\n→ **__21 + 8__** = ?\n\n→ 29. \n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**Option 4**\".",
